          {
            "title": "Match the API Role",
            "id": 152191,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um aplicativo de leitura precisa dos detalhes de um livro em <code>/books/7</code> sem alterar o livro. Qual método HTTP é adequado para essa ação?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um aplicativo de leitura precisa dos detalhes de um livro em <code>/books/7</code> sem alterar o livro. Qual método HTTP é adequado para essa ação?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>POST</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>PATCH</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose a Request Method",
            "id": 152192,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um cliente envia uma substituição completa do perfil em <code>/users/8</code>. Qual método HTTP é adequado para essa ação?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>PUT</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>PATCH</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>POST</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>PUT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Build a GET Request",
            "id": 152193,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a chamada da função que envia uma requisição <code>GET</code> para <code>url</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"books.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/books/7&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Busque o livro em <code>url</code> e armazene o objeto retornado em <code>response</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"books.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/books/7&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>response</code> seguido de <code>requests</code>, <code>get</code> e finalmente <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parse JSON Data",
            "id": 152194,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o método que analisa a resposta como JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"response.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"text\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>json</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Read a Response Value",
            "id": 152195,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A resposta da API é semelhante à seguinte: <code>{\"title\": \"Sky Trails\", \"pages\": 240}</code>.</p><p>Complete o acesso ao dicionário que exibe a quantidade de páginas do livro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"book.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(data[\" /><text value=\"&quot;pages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;title&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;data&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"240\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"pages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check the Status Code",
            "id": 152196,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o atributo response que permite que a condição verifique o código de status <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"status.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"success_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if response.status_code == 200:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o atributo response que permite que a condição verifique o código de status <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"status.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"success_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if response.status_code == 200:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Raise HTTP Errors",
            "id": 152197,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o método response que gera um erro HTTP para um status malsucedido.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"errors.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"response.raise_for_status()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"check_for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"_error\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>raise_for</code> seguido de <code>_status</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch HTTP Errors",
            "id": 152198,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual linha captura o erro HTTP gerado pelo código no bloco <code>try</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"request.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  response.raise_for_status()\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except requests.HTTPError as error:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ValueError as error:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except requests.HTTPError as error:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual linha captura o erro HTTP gerado pelo código no bloco <code>try</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"request.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  response.raise_for_status()\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except requests.HTTPError as error:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ValueError as error:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>except requests.ConnectionError as error:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except requests.HTTPError as error:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Send JSON Data",
            "id": 152199,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a chamada que cria um usuário e envia <code>data</code> como JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"create_user.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"data = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.post(url, json=data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data=json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>post</code> seguido de <code>json=data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um usuário em <code>url</code> e envie o dicionário <code>data</code> como JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"create_user.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"data = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.post(url, json=data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"response\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"text\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>post</code> seguido de <code>url</code>, <code>json</code> e finalmente <code>data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Update One Field",
            "id": 152200,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um perfil já tem um nome e um e-mail. Você só precisa alterar o e-mail dele. Qual chamada corresponde à tarefa?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>requests.patch(url, json=data)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.put(url, json=data)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.post(url, json=data)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>requests.patch(url, json=data)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um perfil já tem um nome e um e-mail. Você só precisa alterar o e-mail dele. Qual chamada corresponde à tarefa?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>requests.patch(url, json=data)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.put(url, json=data)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.post(url, json=data)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.get(url, json=data)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>requests.patch(url, json=data)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
